### Create a new report
POST http://localhost:3000/reports
content-type: application/json

{
    "make": "ford",
    "model": "mustang",
    "year": 1982,
    "price": 20000,
    "mileage": 50000,
    "lat": 45,
    "lng": 45
}

### update a report approval status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/reports/9/approve
content-type: application/json

{
    "approved": true
}

### Get Estimate
GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=ford&model=mustang&year=1981&lng=45&lat=45&mileage=50000
content-type: application/json